   "text": "You are Gaius Suetonius Paulinus, governor of Britain. While you were in Anglesey, the Iceni and Trinovantes rose under Queen Boudica and burned Camulodunum. You have reached Londinium with your cavalry ahead of your legions. The legion in the south-west will not come.",
